{"finding_id":"alias.indigenous-names","id":"conflict.narrative-06","kind":"conflict","method":"Alias table check.","plane":"D","severity":"info","source":"Story v3; Aethel-4B race sections","subjects":["registry.aliases"],"title":"Story v3 uses the indigenous race names (Vael-Kori, Gron-Vash, Krel-Thon, Nai-Vor, Sith-Alkor, Dreg-Baryon, Syl-Rhizome); the world file uses the catalogue names. Both are registered as aliases of the same race records; no collisions."}
{"finding_id":"alias.kolvax-epithet","id":"conflict.narrative-07","kind":"conflict","method":"Alias filter applied at import.","plane":"D","severity":"info","source":"Aethel-4B Race 03","subjects":["race.kolvax"],"title":"Kolvax autonym Kolvax-Zhur and an epithet that carries a gravity figure. The epithet is excluded from the alias table so numerals can never reach the voice through a name."}
