{"finding_id":"laws.g0-exact","id":"conflict.narrative-09","kind":"conflict","method":"Invariant test tolerance 0.1 percent.","plane":"D","severity":"info","source":"Aethel-4B lines 14-40","subjects":["world.aethel-4b"],"title":"The printed bare gravity equals exactly 1.05 G; recomputing from the printed mass and radius gives a value about 0.04 percent lower. The printed constant is used for canon, the derived one for the solver; both are within test tolerance."}
