{"aliases":["Aethel-4b","Vespera-Baryon","the Pendulum World","Iron Nadir","Sol-Aethel"],"body":"codex/world/00-astrophysics.md","body_bytes":3462,"body_sha256":"24a6b194b26ec971e50392ea277f4da1ce2574f1a50dd643104ed193db322066","canon":["Weight is not a promise here; it is a tide. The world turns through a long two-part breath, half light and half dark.","By day the amber sun Sol-Aethel and the dark companion called the Iron Nadir stand aligned overhead and lift the burden from the crust; everything is buoyant, warm and tall.","By night the planet's sloshing heart of osmium and iron slides back and everything grows nearly half again as heavy; the sky collapses into cold, dense air.","Along the moving dawn and dusk borders the pressure cliff unleashes the Grinding Gale, a screaming wall of dust and wind.","At dusk the water table fails and the mangrove spires drain violently into the sinkholes; at dawn the deep vaults must be sealed against decompression.","For ten thousand cycles the eight peoples kept their altitudes and their hours, until the Kolvax fell from a torn sky."],"id":"world.aethel-4b","kind":"world","laws":"laws.world","plane":"B","source_lines":[9,28,31,42,44,47,55],"title":"Aethel-4b — Vespera-Baryon, The Pendulum World"}
{"aliases":["altitude matrix","strata"],"body":"codex/world/altitude-pressure-faction-matrix.md","body_bytes":1646,"body_sha256":"33df4fc05834818ea302f364f42ee631898a86f25e3a5365a8edb33c27a3e386","canon":["Five strata, top to bottom: the Zenith Canopy; the Terminator and surface killing floor; the vertical hydrological siphon and vascular web; the hyper-baric karst vaults; the perovskite core-tide shear.","The surface killing floor is contested by Kolvax citadels, Zephyr-Krel land-clipper fleets, hybrid vanguards and polar observatories."],"id":"world.altitude-matrix","kind":"world","plane":"B","source_lines":[529,544],"title":"Planetary Altitude, Pressure & Factional Hierarchy Matrix"}
